WEBVTT

00:05.670 --> 00:07.390
<b><i>Attack Families!</i></b>

00:06.610 --> 00:09.480
<b>Super Attack Families</b>

00:16.380 --> 00:18.260
<b><i>Found! Okay?</i></b>

00:18.260 --> 00:20.750
<b><i>It was through this game, </i>Attack Families<i>,</i></b>

00:20.740 --> 00:22.330
<b>Winrate: 2221
Now matching...</b>

00:20.750 --> 00:24.490
<b><i>that I, Fumiya Tomozaki, got to know</i></b>

00:22.590 --> 00:23.570
<b><i>Found!</i></b>

00:23.580 --> 00:24.960
<b>Winrate: 2169</b>

00:24.960 --> 00:28.750
<b><i>Aoi Hinami, the heroine of our school,</i></b>

00:28.750 --> 00:30.390
<b><i>and, with her secret coaching,</i></b>

00:30.790 --> 00:34.210
<b><i>began to walk away from my 
low-tier-character self.</i></b>

00:35.210 --> 00:37.200
<b><i>She got me growing and developing</i></b>

00:37.200 --> 00:40.110
<b><i>by seeing life as a game, 
and myself as the character I main.</i></b>

00:41.610 --> 00:46.600
<b><i>Hinami's strict with her instruction, 
and we don't always see eye to eye,</i></b>

00:46.600 --> 00:51.920
<b><i>but little by little, I've come to see 
how fun this game of life can be.</i></b>

00:56.830 --> 00:58.820
<b><i>Our eventful summer vacation 
has come to an end...</i></b>

00:59.670 --> 01:01.000
<b><i>Game set!</i></b>

01:01.690 --> 01:03.730
<b><i>Winner: Found!</i></b>

01:01.930 --> 01:02.940
<b>One more match!</b>

01:03.450 --> 01:04.460
<b>NO NAME: One more match!!</b>

01:05.300 --> 01:06.950
<b>Bring it on!</b>

01:07.210 --> 01:09.590
<b>...and tomorrow's the first 
day of the second term.</b>

01:10.290 --> 01:14.210
<b>2nd Stage: Lv. 1
The best games make reconnaissance fun</b>

01:19.450 --> 01:20.840
<b>There.</b>

01:25.990 --> 01:29.220
<b>You've gotten better. 
Still have a long way to go, though.</b>

01:29.670 --> 01:31.000
<b>Th-thanks...</b>

01:36.360 --> 01:38.360
<b>Sewing Room 2</b>

01:36.370 --> 01:40.760
<b>Okay, since it's the first 
day of the second term...</b>

01:42.480 --> 01:46.000
<b>let's confirm a few things 
before we move forward.</b>

01:46.290 --> 01:48.000
<b>Sure thing. Hit me!</b>

01:48.250 --> 01:53.440
<b>Your ultimate goal is
"To be as satisfied with offline life as I am."</b>

01:50.250 --> 01:55.590
<b>Ultimate Goal
To be as satisfied with offline life as I am</b>

01:53.440 --> 01:56.300
<b>Your medium goal on the way there</b>

01:55.590 --> 01:59.260
<b>Medium Goal: Have a girlfriend before year 3</b>

01:56.300 --> 01:59.270
<b>is "Have a girlfriend 
before starting year 3."</b>

01:59.270 --> 02:00.800
<b>Got that?</b>

02:00.800 --> 02:01.760
<b>Yep.</b>

02:01.760 --> 02:06.620
<b>As long as meeting that goal doesn't 
involve any false confessions of love</b>

02:06.620 --> 02:10.280
<b>or spouting superficial stuff I don't mean,</b>

02:11.140 --> 02:13.010
<b>I don't have a problem with it.</b>

02:13.010 --> 02:15.770
<b>Very well. Then let's start...</b>

02:17.280 --> 02:18.400
<b>with this:</b>

02:19.270 --> 02:22.790
<b>observing interpersonal 
relationships in the classroom.</b>

02:19.280 --> 02:22.780
<b>Today's Task
Observe interpersonal relationships in class</b>

02:23.130 --> 02:27.080
<b>It'll lay the groundwork for learning 
how to read the mood in a room,</b>

02:27.080 --> 02:28.790
<b>and eventually how to control that mood.</b>

02:29.100 --> 02:31.660
<b>Just so you know, the key here is--</b>

02:31.660 --> 02:33.680
<b>It's okay--I know.</b>

02:34.350 --> 02:38.260
<b>If I find a situation that'll 
give me XP for trying,</b>

02:38.840 --> 02:41.320
<b>take the initiative and plunge right in.</b>

02:43.060 --> 02:44.500
<b>HEXactly!</b>

02:44.790 --> 02:46.230
<b>And there it is.</b>

02:49.490 --> 02:50.900
<b>Hey, Fumiya.</b>

02:50.900 --> 02:53.910
<b>Oh, hey. Morning, Mizusawa.</b>

02:54.180 --> 02:55.790
<b>Hey, did you hear?</b>

02:56.260 --> 02:57.280
<b>Hear what?</b>

02:58.790 --> 02:59.790
<b>Well...</b>

03:02.780 --> 03:05.250
<b>What?! Nakamura and Izumi?</b>

03:05.250 --> 03:08.500
<b>Shh! They're not making it public yet.</b>

03:09.020 --> 03:11.880
<b>You know how Erika is into Shuji, right?</b>

03:12.530 --> 03:18.430
<b>If this gets out, it'll mess up Izumi's 
standing among the Konno girls.</b>

03:18.430 --> 03:20.140
<b>R-right...</b>

03:22.450 --> 03:23.430
<b>Hey.</b>

03:23.430 --> 03:25.350
<b>Yo, Takahiro! And Army Boy!</b>

03:25.350 --> 03:25.900
<b>Hey.</b>

03:26.380 --> 03:27.130
<b>Yo.</b>

03:27.130 --> 03:29.540
<b>Mo... morning.</b>

03:29.540 --> 03:30.930
<b>Brain!</b>

03:31.310 --> 03:35.070
<b>Long time no see! Ooh, ooh--check this out!</b>

03:35.070 --> 03:38.070
<b>See? It's the dolls I gave everyone!</b>

03:38.070 --> 03:40.590
<b>AKA proof of our friendship!</b>

03:40.590 --> 03:42.530
<b>We all put 'em on our bags!</b>

03:42.530 --> 03:44.340
<b>Great minds think alike!</b>

03:44.340 --> 03:47.100
<b>You gotta put yours on 
your bag, too, Brain.</b>

03:47.100 --> 03:49.580
<b>Then we'll all match!</b>

03:49.580 --> 03:51.840
<b>No, I-I think I'll pass, thanks.</b>

03:51.840 --> 03:54.850
<b>Ack! I've been shot down...</b>

03:54.850 --> 03:57.180
<b>Oh, Tama! I'm just <i>shocked</i>!</b>

03:57.180 --> 04:00.610
<b>Watch it, Minmi! Quit being so handsy!</b>

04:00.610 --> 04:03.090
<b>Oh, pitiful old me! I need consoling!</b>

04:03.090 --> 04:04.330
<b>Sniffity sniff.</b>

04:03.630 --> 04:05.860
<b>And no sniffing people!</b>

04:05.860 --> 04:06.820
<b>You're adorable!</b>

04:09.760 --> 04:11.890
<b>Good morning, Kikuchi.</b>

04:11.890 --> 04:14.610
<b>Good morning, Tomozaki.</b>

04:17.560 --> 04:19.350
<b>Hiya, Tomozaki.</b>

04:19.850 --> 04:22.300
<b>Oh, hey, Izumi. It's been a while.</b>

04:22.300 --> 04:23.100
<b>Yes, it has!</b>

04:23.100 --> 04:25.070
<b>I hear things are going great.</b>

04:25.070 --> 04:26.000
<b>With Nakamura.</b>

04:26.000 --> 04:29.160
<b>Huh? Oh... y'know...</b>

04:34.870 --> 04:39.270
<b>Now, today we're going to pick class 
captains for the sports tournament,</b>

04:36.880 --> 04:39.270
<b>Sports Tournament / Captains / Boys: / Girls:</b>

04:39.270 --> 04:41.940
<b>one boy and one girl.</b>

04:39.380 --> 04:41.940
<b>Events / Boys: Basketball / Soccer / Baseball</b>

04:41.940 --> 04:45.630
<b>Girls: Basketball / Volleyball / Softball</b>

04:41.940 --> 04:45.630
<b>Then the boys and girls 
will each pick one event.</b>

04:45.630 --> 04:50.260
<b>The captains' first job is to decide 
which event to compete in.</b>

04:50.640 --> 04:53.030
<b>Any interested candidates?</b>

04:53.270 --> 04:55.350
<b>I'll do it!</b>

04:55.350 --> 04:58.040
<b>Seriously? You want Takei in charge?</b>

04:58.040 --> 05:00.520
<b>He can't strategize his 
way out of a paper bag!</b>

05:00.520 --> 05:03.450
<b>No sweat! We've got soccer, don't we?</b>

05:03.450 --> 05:06.380
<b>Well, I'm on the soccer team. 
My leadership is on point!</b>

05:06.380 --> 05:07.560
<b>Takei!</b>

05:08.530 --> 05:12.780
<b>Weren't you the soccer captain last year--
right before a sudden losing streak?</b>

05:12.780 --> 05:15.720
<b>Geez, Shuji, you remember that?!</b>

05:19.460 --> 05:22.630
<b>Okay, that's Takei for the boys.</b>

05:21.460 --> 05:23.090
<b>Sports Tournament / Captains
Boys: Takei / Girls:</b>

05:23.310 --> 05:24.990
<b>What about the girls?</b>

05:24.990 --> 05:26.610
<b>Anyone?</b>

05:26.610 --> 05:29.010
<b>You're not gonna do it, Aoi?</b>

05:30.280 --> 05:34.260
<b>I've got my student council 
president gig--I probably can't.</b>

05:34.260 --> 05:36.050
<b>Aw, seriously?</b>

05:36.050 --> 05:37.090
<b>Don't take it personally.</b>

05:37.710 --> 05:40.090
<b><i>No one</i> wants to work with you.</b>

05:40.090 --> 05:42.230
<b>What?! Is <i>that</i> what's going on?</b>

05:45.980 --> 05:47.730
<b>What's wrong with Yuzu?</b>

05:47.730 --> 05:49.860
<b>Huh? M-me?</b>

05:49.860 --> 05:52.560
<b>You were our first-year 
captain, weren't you?</b>

05:52.560 --> 05:56.200
<b>Oh... um, but...</b>

05:59.850 --> 06:02.450
<b>This year? I-I don't know...</b>

06:05.010 --> 06:06.290
<b>Huh.</b>

06:06.970 --> 06:08.460
<b>Well, whatever.</b>

06:12.340 --> 06:13.990
<b>Okay, then:</b>

06:14.480 --> 06:16.270
<b>What about Hirabayashi?</b>

06:16.270 --> 06:17.140
<b>Huh?</b>

06:17.140 --> 06:19.080
<b>She's good at, like, preparation and stuff.</b>

06:19.080 --> 06:21.350
<b>Yeah, she <i>is</i> pretty preparation-y.</b>

06:22.380 --> 06:23.860
<b>What's that even mean?</b>

06:24.170 --> 06:29.130
<b>It'd be a big help if you'd be the 
girls' captain, Hirabayashi.</b>

06:33.790 --> 06:37.970
<b><i>Right now I lack the power to do 
anything about this situation.</i></b>

06:38.620 --> 06:44.250
<b><i>Say the wrong thing and I risk putting 
Hirabayashi in an even tighter spot.</i></b>

06:44.620 --> 06:47.610
<b>So what's it gonna be, Hirabayashi?</b>

06:49.370 --> 06:51.750
<b>W-well, um...</b>

06:52.820 --> 06:54.760
<b>I'll... I'll do it.</b>

06:54.760 --> 07:00.330
<b>You don't need to let anyone twist 
your arm on this, Hirabayashi.</b>

07:00.330 --> 07:03.770
<b>No, um... it's fine.</b>

07:04.760 --> 07:05.910
<b>Okay.</b>

07:05.910 --> 07:08.690
<b><i>Groups are tough, all right.</i></b>

07:05.910 --> 07:08.690
<b>Then Hirabayashi will be the girls' captain.</b>

07:09.080 --> 07:12.770
<b><i>Izumi was kind of blah all day after that.</i></b>

07:12.770 --> 07:18.150
<b><i>She probably feels responsible for 
Hirabayashi being put on the spot</i></b>

07:14.910 --> 07:18.160
<b>Boys: Takei / Girls: Hirabayashi</b>

07:18.150 --> 07:20.120
<b><i>after she turned down the captain gig.</i></b>

07:30.770 --> 07:33.770
<b><i>Plenty happened this first 
day of the second term.</i></b>

07:34.070 --> 07:37.100
<b><i>A secret meeting with the school 
heroine in the morning.</i></b>

07:37.600 --> 07:41.350
<b><i>A normal conversation with 
girls in the classroom.</i></b>

07:41.870 --> 07:45.230
<b><i>Hanging out among normie guys after school,</i></b>

07:45.230 --> 07:47.100
<b><i>teasing and being teased.</i></b>

07:49.690 --> 07:54.320
<b><i>I've gone through unimaginable 
changes these past few months.</i></b>

07:54.720 --> 07:59.090
<b><i>But I didn't use a continue, 
and I didn't cheat my way here.</i></b>

07:59.090 --> 08:04.060
<b><i>I've just been walking a little 
further forward--every day.</i></b>

08:05.180 --> 08:05.960
<b><i>Still,</i></b>

08:06.450 --> 08:09.330
<b><i>if that's true, when did she--</i></b>

08:09.330 --> 08:15.330
<b><i>when did Aoi Hinami start on </i>her<i> path, 
and how far has she come?</i></b>

08:16.210 --> 08:21.910
<b><i>She got this far with dogged effort 
after effort, just like me.</i></b>

08:22.870 --> 08:28.360
<b><i>But there's one big difference 
between Hinami and me:</i></b>

08:28.910 --> 08:34.110
<b><i>Whereas I'm having fun and experiencing 
the sparkle along the way,</i></b>

08:34.440 --> 08:39.030
<b><i>she's set her eyes on 
some far distant point</i></b>

08:39.030 --> 08:43.460
<b><i>and is absorbed in moving forward, 
like that itself is her only goal.</i></b>

08:44.520 --> 08:49.010
<b><i>What let her keep going for this long?</i></b>

08:49.880 --> 08:51.880
<b>Sewing Room 2</b>

08:51.880 --> 08:56.140
<b>Mood = Norm for good/bad among a group</b>

08:52.200 --> 08:56.150
<b>"Mood" refers to the norm for 
good or bad among a group.</b>

08:56.690 --> 09:02.340
<b>Erika Konno used the "plain 
equals bad" mood...</b>

09:02.340 --> 09:06.030
<b>...to label Hirabayashi as lower-ranked</b>

09:05.350 --> 09:06.980
<b>Boys: Takei / Girls: Hirabayashi</b>

09:06.030 --> 09:09.360
<b>and push a hassle of a job onto her.</b>

09:09.360 --> 09:13.350
<b>That's right. Manipulating 
this kind of group mood...</b>

09:14.490 --> 09:16.250
<b>...is a must-have skill for being</b>

09:14.490 --> 09:17.610
<b>Ultimate Goal
To be as satisfied with offline life as I am</b>

09:16.250 --> 09:17.620
<b>satisfied with offline life.</b>

09:17.620 --> 09:20.360
<b>So your next small goal</b>

09:20.370 --> 09:24.120
<b>Small Goal: Get Erika Konno motivated
for the sports tournament</b>

09:20.620 --> 09:22.290
<b>is to get Erika Konno motivated</b>

09:22.290 --> 09:24.110
<b>for the sports tournament.</b>

09:24.110 --> 09:25.090
<b>What?!</b>

09:25.090 --> 09:28.830
<b>Now hang on a second! 
There's no way that's even possible!</b>

09:29.030 --> 09:32.450
<b>Which is why it's going to 
take some trial and error.</b>

09:32.450 --> 09:37.590
<b>It'll be a good way to practice the 
interpersonal skills you've learned.</b>

09:38.230 --> 09:42.100
<b>It might actually be the game-iest 
assignment you've had so far.</b>

09:42.100 --> 09:44.080
<b>"Game-iest"?</b>

09:44.080 --> 09:45.100
<b>Oh!</b>

09:45.800 --> 09:47.450
<b>I get it:</b>

09:46.390 --> 09:49.100
<b>Assignment Quest
Konno Erika / ~ In Search of Motivation Lost ~</b>

09:47.450 --> 09:49.100
<b>This task--</b>

09:49.340 --> 09:51.350
<b>this is an RPG, isn't it?</b>

09:52.850 --> 09:54.720
<b>That's our nanashi!</b>

09:55.940 --> 09:57.950
<b>Bottom-Tier Character Tomozaki S2</b>

09:58.660 --> 10:01.460
<b><i>The first order of business in an RPG</i></b>

09:59.240 --> 10:01.450
<b>Assignment Quest
Konno Erika / ~ In Search of Motivation Lost ~</b>

10:01.460 --> 10:03.770
<b><i>is doing some reconnaissance in town.</i></b>

10:04.920 --> 10:09.130
<b><i>In other words, 
if Erika Konno is the dungeon boss,</i></b>

10:05.040 --> 10:06.460
<b>Erika Konno / Fumiya Tomozaki</b>

10:06.460 --> 10:07.710
<b>Erika Konno appeared!!!</b>

10:08.460 --> 10:09.710
<b>But Fumiya Tomozaki</b>

10:09.130 --> 10:13.490
<b><i>I should ask around to learn her 
weak points and how to defeat her.</i></b>

10:09.960 --> 10:11.210
<b>is still no match for her!!!</b>

10:12.880 --> 10:13.630
<b>Fumiya Tomozaki: Got a sec, Izumi?</b>

10:14.000 --> 10:14.760
<b>Yuzu Izumi: Huh? What is it?</b>

10:14.450 --> 10:18.270
<b><i>Ooh! This is really starting 
to feel like a game now!</i></b>

10:19.560 --> 10:23.020
<b>Mmm, Erika really is 
completely unmotivated.</b>

10:23.020 --> 10:24.400
<b>She sure is.</b>

10:24.400 --> 10:27.050
<b>Hirabayashi doesn't have it easy, either.</b>

10:27.050 --> 10:29.630
<b>I'm not sure she's the captain type...</b>

10:29.630 --> 10:32.700
<b>What do you think it would 
take to motivate Konno?</b>

10:32.700 --> 10:35.040
<b>That's a tough one.</b>

10:35.040 --> 10:37.520
<b>Wait, why do you ask?</b>

10:37.520 --> 10:39.120
<b>Oh, it's just--</b>

10:39.120 --> 10:43.310
<b>I just thought I'd help Hirabayashi 
in whatever little way I can.</b>

10:43.310 --> 10:46.250
<b>I mean, I'd like to enjoy the tournament...</b>

10:47.540 --> 10:48.670
<b>I totally get it!</b>

10:48.670 --> 10:51.710
<b>I'm the type that wants to enjoy the 
<i>heck</i> out of the sports tournament</b>

10:51.710 --> 10:54.000
<b>and the culture festival and <i>everything</i>!</b>

10:54.000 --> 10:56.450
<b>So I was wondering if there 
was anything we could do</b>

10:56.450 --> 10:58.670
<b>about Erika's lack of excitement.</b>

10:58.920 --> 11:01.910
<b>I get along especially well with Erika,</b>

11:01.910 --> 11:06.480
<b>but Shuji... well, he's not big 
on talking this stuff out.</b>

11:06.940 --> 11:09.420
<b>Oh... is that so...</b>

11:11.430 --> 11:14.440
<b>How to get Erika motivated... hmm...</b>

11:14.680 --> 11:17.050
<b>She's a real stickler about 
clothes and fashion--</b>

11:17.050 --> 11:20.940
<b>she'd probably step it up if I promised 
her pricey cosmetics when we win.</b>

11:20.940 --> 11:23.570
<b>Yeah, I-I don't know...</b>

11:23.570 --> 11:26.740
<b>Oh! Softball might do the trick, actually!</b>

11:26.740 --> 11:29.750
<b>She was on the boys' baseball 
team in elementary school.</b>

11:31.140 --> 11:33.460
<b>Konno, playing boys' baseball?</b>

11:33.950 --> 11:35.460
<b>You don't say...</b>

11:48.350 --> 11:51.850
<b>Ah, Tomozaki. Nice work today.</b>

11:52.180 --> 11:54.110
<b>You on break, too, Narita?</b>

11:55.200 --> 11:57.230
<b>You can call me "Gumi."</b>

11:57.230 --> 11:58.840
<b>Oof.</b>

11:59.100 --> 12:00.970
<b><i>This is Tsugumi Narita.</i></b>

12:00.970 --> 12:04.830
<b><i>She's a year younger than me, 
but my senior here at work.</i></b>

12:04.830 --> 12:07.550
<b>Actually, my shift just ended,</b>

12:07.550 --> 12:11.510
<b>but I'm kinda exhausted, so I thought 
I'd rest a while before I left.</b>

12:12.460 --> 12:15.240
<b>You sure get exhausted a lot.</b>

12:15.240 --> 12:17.240
<b>That's right--and I hate it.</b>

12:17.240 --> 12:22.260
<b>Which is why I think I'm gonna try 
to move as little as possible.</b>

12:22.260 --> 12:24.730
<b>No, you need to <i>do</i> your <i>job</i>.</b>

12:24.730 --> 12:29.530
<b>Aw! Don't you want to make money 
in the breeziest way possible?</b>

12:29.530 --> 12:34.300
<b>I want a zero-effort, no-walking, 
never-tiring, always-resting life.</b>

12:34.300 --> 12:38.010
<b><i>That</i> is my policy.</b>

12:38.010 --> 12:43.280
<b>Straight from the planet Apathy, 
it's Gumi! Thanks in advance.</b>

12:44.980 --> 12:46.830
<b>Wait, so in that case...</b>

12:46.830 --> 12:49.700
<b>Do you drag your feet when it come 
to sports tournaments, too?</b>

12:49.700 --> 12:51.620
<b>You betcha.</b>

12:51.950 --> 12:53.450
<b><i>Aha...</i></b>

12:54.380 --> 12:58.700
<b><i>In some ways, her attributes 
are similar to Erika Konno's.</i></b>

12:59.760 --> 13:01.970
<b>Hey, can I get some advice?</b>

13:03.320 --> 13:06.630
<b>Oh, wow, what a pain.</b>

13:06.630 --> 13:10.630
<b>Erika definitely has it out 
for that Hirabayashi girl.</b>

13:10.630 --> 13:12.300
<b>I kind of thought as much.</b>

13:12.560 --> 13:16.490
<b>I mean, as soon as Hirabayashi 
takes on the captain role,</b>

13:16.490 --> 13:19.300
<b>I doubt Erika is gonna wanna 
do much of anything.</b>

13:19.300 --> 13:21.070
<b>Unless something crazy happens.</b>

13:21.320 --> 13:23.610
<b>Something crazy? Like what?</b>

13:23.610 --> 13:27.710
<b>With me, it all comes down 
to bang for your buck.</b>

13:27.710 --> 13:29.410
<b>Low effort, high reward.</b>

13:29.650 --> 13:31.200
<b>Oh, I get it.</b>

13:31.200 --> 13:33.910
<b>So if Erika Konno feels the same way...</b>

13:33.910 --> 13:35.570
<b>Right, yeah.</b>

13:35.570 --> 13:39.420
<b>She'll be plenty motivated if she can get 
what she wants in a cost-effective way.</b>

13:39.420 --> 13:43.060
<b>That's just how we roll 
on the planet Apathy.</b>

13:43.420 --> 13:46.040
<b>Low effort, high reward...</b>

13:51.210 --> 13:53.940
<b><i>The next person I thought I'd speak with</i></b>

13:53.930 --> 13:56.690
<b>Read: I'd like your advice. Can you meet today?
Fuka Kikuchi: Sure. Where should we meet?
Read: How about The Baron?
Fuka Kikuchi: Got it</b>

13:54.310 --> 13:55.590
<b><i>was Kikuchi.</i></b>

13:56.690 --> 13:59.130
<b><i>She may not stand out in class,</i></b>

13:56.690 --> 14:03.190
<b>The Baron / Open 24 Hours</b>

13:59.130 --> 14:01.740
<b><i>but she's writing her very own novel,</i></b>

14:01.740 --> 14:04.680
<b><i>and I think she's a great observer of people.</i></b>

14:03.190 --> 14:04.690
<b>Fuka Kikuchi:
Sorry to keep you waiting, Tomozaki</b>

14:05.060 --> 14:08.420
<b>I-I'm sorry for contacting 
you out of the blue.</b>

14:08.420 --> 14:12.570
<b>No, it's fine. You caught me as 
I was getting off work, too.</b>

14:12.830 --> 14:15.340
<b>I'm just happy for the invitation.</b>

14:21.310 --> 14:23.220
<b>Konno?</b>

14:23.220 --> 14:23.840
<b>Uh-huh.</b>

14:23.840 --> 14:27.080
<b>What kind of person is she, 
from your point of view?</b>

14:27.080 --> 14:30.610
<b>What kind of person...? That's a tough one.</b>

14:30.610 --> 14:32.740
<b>I mean, like...</b>

14:32.740 --> 14:35.860
<b>We're having all these discussions 
about the sports tournament,</b>

14:35.860 --> 14:38.100
<b>and Konno is totally unmotivated, right?</b>

14:38.100 --> 14:42.370
<b>Under what circumstances do you 
think she gives it her all?</b>

14:42.370 --> 14:45.150
<b>What would motivate Konno...</b>

14:47.860 --> 14:52.610
<b>This may not be a very nice 
way of putting it, but...</b>

14:53.070 --> 14:58.580
<b>I think she <i>really</i> doesn't want people to 
look down on her. That motivates her.</b>

14:58.580 --> 15:01.330
<b>People looking down on her, huh...?</b>

15:01.330 --> 15:03.060
<b>R-right.</b>

15:05.380 --> 15:09.770
<b>But why be like this for 
the sports tournament?</b>

15:09.770 --> 15:14.850
<b>Well... if she acts like the 
tournament is already stupid,</b>

15:15.150 --> 15:18.110
<b>then win or lose, no one 
will look down on her.</b>

15:18.110 --> 15:20.100
<b>That's what <i>I</i> think, anyway.</b>

15:20.440 --> 15:21.720
<b>I can see that...</b>

15:25.010 --> 15:26.600
<b>Oh, but...</b>

15:26.960 --> 15:32.290
<b>Konno does have her friendly 
side, and she's so honest--</b>

15:32.290 --> 15:34.550
<b>I don't think she's <i>bad</i>, per se...</b>

15:34.550 --> 15:35.610
<b>Uh-huh.</b>

15:37.810 --> 15:40.860
<b><i>Now for all the intel I've 
managed to collect:</i></b>

15:40.860 --> 15:44.360
<b><i>In order to light a fire 
under Erika Konno, first...</i></b>

15:45.650 --> 15:47.380
<b><i>we make sure the girls' event is softball.</i></b>

15:47.860 --> 15:48.850
<b><i>Next...</i></b>

15:49.800 --> 15:53.270
<b><i>we find a low-effort, high-return way</i></b>

15:53.270 --> 15:57.210
<b><i>to stimulate her desire not 
to be looked down upon.</i></b>

15:57.520 --> 16:00.260
<b><i>And what I need now</i></b>

16:00.260 --> 16:03.750
<b><i>is to find that key item that'll 
hit her right where it counts.</i></b>

16:04.980 --> 16:05.900
<b>Okay:</b>

16:05.900 --> 16:13.860
<b>Boys
1. Basketball / 2. Soccer / 3. Baseball
Chosen Sports Tournament Events</b>

16:06.150 --> 16:09.490
<b>The boys' first choice is basketball!</b>

16:09.490 --> 16:12.580
<b>I would have preferred soccer, 
but whaddya gonna do?</b>

16:12.580 --> 16:13.870
<b>Takei!</b>

16:14.130 --> 16:16.760
<b>Can you even <i>be</i> a basketball captain?</b>

16:16.370 --> 16:19.200
<b>Boys
1. Basketball / 2. Soccer / 3. Baseball</b>

16:16.760 --> 16:19.460
<b>No sweat! I've been reading the manga!</b>

16:19.850 --> 16:21.710
<b>"No sweat"--yeah, right!</b>

16:23.520 --> 16:26.160
<b>All right--now for the girls.</b>

16:25.460 --> 16:30.460
<b>Chosen Sports Tournament Events
Girls / Basketball / Volleyball / Softball</b>

16:26.160 --> 16:28.630
<b>Uh, um...</b>

16:28.630 --> 16:33.960
<b>Then, uh, l-let's see what the girls want.</b>

16:34.390 --> 16:37.600
<b>Ooh! Ooh! It's basketball for me!</b>

16:37.600 --> 16:40.740
<b>With me and Aoi on the team, we can't lose!</b>

16:40.740 --> 16:41.470
<b>Right?</b>

16:42.540 --> 16:44.110
<b>Basketball... okay.</b>

16:44.430 --> 16:46.360
<b>Anyone else have any preferences?</b>

16:46.650 --> 16:50.480
<b><i>This is bad. They'll never 
get to softball like this.</i></b>

16:52.350 --> 16:53.280
<b>I do!</b>

16:54.620 --> 16:56.570
<b>I want to play volleyball.</b>

16:57.830 --> 16:59.330
<b>One for volleyball.</b>

16:59.820 --> 17:02.320
<b>Which should be our first choice?</b>

17:02.320 --> 17:06.840
<b>Oh, I think I'd prefer 
softball... or something.</b>

17:07.160 --> 17:08.820
<b>Softball.</b>

17:09.280 --> 17:11.830
<b>Do you all have reasons for your choices?</b>

17:12.110 --> 17:13.710
<b>I do! Because that's what I wanna play.</b>

17:19.960 --> 17:21.180
<b>Tama!</b>

17:21.180 --> 17:24.260
<b>That's too simple to be a reason!</b>

17:26.980 --> 17:28.990
<b>Th-then we'll move on to--</b>

17:28.990 --> 17:30.220
<b>But, like...</b>

17:30.690 --> 17:32.740
<b>Why don't we just vote?</b>

17:33.140 --> 17:36.110
<b>Oh, yeah... right.</b>

17:39.250 --> 17:41.610
<b>Let's not go there, Konno.</b>

17:41.610 --> 17:45.530
<b>I get it--I'm usually the first 
to want to put things to a vote.</b>

17:46.200 --> 17:49.290
<b>But I'd like to see if you can 
talk things out instead.</b>

17:50.140 --> 17:52.810
<b>I'll take over from here.</b>

17:53.090 --> 17:57.680
<b>Each of you has to convince the class 
with the reasons behind your choices.</b>

17:56.300 --> 18:01.810
<b>Sekitomo</b>

17:59.950 --> 18:03.560
<b>Okay, after all that discussion, 
the girls have decided</b>

18:01.810 --> 18:03.310
<b>Basketball: 2 / Volleyball: 3 / Softball: 1</b>

18:03.310 --> 18:05.560
<b>Softball: 1</b>

18:03.560 --> 18:05.290
<b>their first choice is softball.</b>

18:05.930 --> 18:10.060
<b>The results will be posted over 
lunch, so keep your eyes peeled.</b>

18:12.070 --> 18:14.070
<b>Sports Tournament: Class Events</b>

18:16.070 --> 18:18.570
<b>Boys: Basketball / Girls: Softball</b>

18:19.670 --> 18:22.570
<b>How to get Erika motivated, huh?</b>

18:23.220 --> 18:26.320
<b>I think it'll be pretty tough 
the way things are now.</b>

18:26.720 --> 18:29.010
<b>How <i>are</i> things now, exactly?</b>

18:30.210 --> 18:34.000
<b>I mean, as long as Hirabayashi's 
the captain...</b>

18:34.000 --> 18:37.520
<b>Oh, right. I figured as much...</b>

18:41.850 --> 18:43.110
<b>I've made up my mind.</b>

18:44.180 --> 18:47.590
<b>I'll take over the captain 
position from Hirabayashi!</b>

18:48.610 --> 18:51.230
<b>She looks like she's having a rough time.</b>

18:51.230 --> 18:53.480
<b>Are you sure about this, though?</b>

18:54.100 --> 18:58.850
<b>I was struggling with whether 
I should help her.</b>

18:59.180 --> 19:04.600
<b>If I'd taken the captain job, 
it'd basically be like Erika told me to.</b>

19:04.600 --> 19:08.440
<b>I'd be going along just to get along, 
and I don't like that side of me.</b>

19:08.440 --> 19:13.830
<b>But that doesn't matter! I'm helping 
Hirabayashi because I want to.</b>

19:14.390 --> 19:18.500
<b>That's good enough, right? 
I <i>want</i> to do it, after all!</b>

19:18.500 --> 19:23.380
<b>And I think it might motivate 
Erika a little bit, too.</b>

19:23.690 --> 19:25.090
<b>But, Yuzu...</b>

19:25.610 --> 19:27.290
<b>Are you really okay with this?</b>

19:27.290 --> 19:29.390
<b>Yeah! And I'll work hard, too!</b>

19:29.880 --> 19:30.880
<b>Huh...</b>

19:31.390 --> 19:36.570
<b><i>She's neither bowing to the mood 
or being pushed into the job.</i></b>

19:36.570 --> 19:38.090
<b>She's<i> calling the shots.</i></b>

19:38.500 --> 19:42.370
<b><i>And that "I'm over it" smile... 
She's a top-tier character, all right.</i></b>

19:43.700 --> 19:47.570
<b><i>A strategy began to come 
together in my head.</i></b>

19:47.570 --> 19:51.660
<b><i>A plan that just might get 
Konno ready and raring to go.</i></b>

19:53.730 --> 19:55.810
<b><i>The first item I'd need...</i></b>

19:57.840 --> 19:59.850
<b>What'd you want to talk about, Brain?</b>

20:00.580 --> 20:03.080
<b>Don't tell me--is it romance advice?!</b>

20:03.080 --> 20:04.500
<b>Nothing like that!</b>

20:04.500 --> 20:07.920
<b>It's actually about Konno.</b>

20:07.920 --> 20:09.530
<b>Erika?</b>

20:09.800 --> 20:14.250
<b>Would you say Konno sees 
Hinami as her rival?</b>

20:15.400 --> 20:18.910
<b>I think so, yeah. 
But where'd this come from?</b>

20:18.910 --> 20:22.270
<b>Oh, I have this idea, that's all.</b>

20:30.160 --> 20:32.720
<b>The next must-have item...</b>

20:33.400 --> 20:34.750
<b>Uh, hey...</b>

20:34.750 --> 20:36.660
<b>Hmm? What's up?</b>

20:36.660 --> 20:39.530
<b>You said Konno likes Nakamura.</b>

20:39.530 --> 20:41.430
<b>And that's a sure thing, right?</b>

20:41.430 --> 20:44.730
<b>Yeah. They're keeping it 
on the down-low, though.</b>

20:45.050 --> 20:46.330
<b>Why do you ask?</b>

20:50.700 --> 20:53.450
<b>My strategy had come together.</b>

20:51.390 --> 20:54.060
<b>Assignment Quest
Konno Erika / ~ In Search of Motivation Lost ~</b>

20:55.140 --> 20:56.190
<b>Hey...</b>

20:56.190 --> 20:59.180
<b>I'd like to confirm something 
about my assignment.</b>

20:56.190 --> 20:59.190
<b>Small Goal: Get Erika Konno motivated
for the sports tournament</b>

20:59.620 --> 21:00.850
<b>Confirm something?</b>

21:00.850 --> 21:03.860
<b>I don't have to do this 
all by myself, right?</b>

21:04.180 --> 21:07.440
<b>You won't mind if I get 
other people to help out?</b>

21:07.440 --> 21:10.870
<b>Good question. Given that you're 
up against Erika Konno,</b>

21:10.870 --> 21:14.370
<b>your skill alone may not be 
enough to get the job done.</b>

21:14.370 --> 21:16.040
<b>In that case...</b>

21:17.360 --> 21:20.670
<b>could I even get <i>your</i> help, too?</b>

21:21.280 --> 21:23.050
<b><i>My</i> help...?</b>

21:23.370 --> 21:27.580
<b>I'm not going to ask you what I should do.</b>

21:27.580 --> 21:30.130
<b>But can I include you in my strategy,</b>

21:30.130 --> 21:34.140
<b>tell you what I need you to 
do, and have you do it?</b>

21:34.730 --> 21:38.220
<b>In other words, I'm still the 
one with the controller--</b>

21:38.220 --> 21:41.580
<b>but I'd be using you as 
my selected character.</b>

21:41.580 --> 21:45.110
<b>Ah, I see. That would be fine.</b>

21:45.110 --> 21:46.470
<b>Yes!</b>

21:46.470 --> 21:47.460
<b>However...</b>

21:47.980 --> 21:52.370
<b>I won't interfere, not even if I think 
your strategy's bound to fail.</b>

21:52.720 --> 21:53.740
<b>What's more...</b>

21:54.640 --> 21:58.390
<b>If there's any chance I'll 
take damage, forget it.</b>

21:58.950 --> 22:01.080
<b>That's fine by me.</b>

22:01.080 --> 22:03.960
<b>All right! Now, about my strategy...</b>

22:04.440 --> 22:05.370
<b>Here it is.</b>

22:05.890 --> 22:06.980
<b>What's that?</b>

22:08.410 --> 22:10.200
<b>A three-pronged approach!</b>
